  "nameEn": "Lake with Functions",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Function \"Bridge side\": while you can jump — jump, repair sparking lamps and light dark ones, leave the shining ones. Call it on every side, turning right.",
  "descriptionEn": "The bridge goes around the lake. Its lamps vary: shining, dark and sparking. All the work on one side fits in a function.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Function \"Bridge side\": while you can jump — jump, only repair sparking lamps and turn off the shining ones. Call it on every side, turning right."
